WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

00:01.565 --> 00:04.067 align:center line:81%
Thank you for that precious rendition.

00:05.435 --> 00:10.874 align:center line:79%
Charles Dickens famously began
his classic novel, “A Tale of Two Cities”

00:11.675 --> 00:15.245 align:center line:79%
with the assertion
that, “It was the best of times;

00:15.245 --> 00:16.747 align:center line:81%
it was the worst of times.”

00:17.548 --> 00:20.183 align:center line:81%
In a sense, this is true in our day.

00:21.318 --> 00:25.889 align:center line:79%
We live in a turbulent time when
the “whole earth [is] in commotion.”

00:26.723 --> 00:29.560 align:center line:81%
President Russell M. Nelson’s admonition,

00:30.494 --> 00:34.831 align:center line:79%
as followers of Jesus Christ,
to be peacemakers

00:34.831 --> 00:39.836 align:center line:79%
was emphasized beautifully this morning by
Elder Gary E. Stevenson.

00:40.837 --> 00:45.842 align:center line:79%
This is an essential part
of fostering unity, peace,

00:46.076 --> 00:48.812 align:center line:81%
and healing for “the worst of times.”

00:49.913 --> 00:54.051 align:center line:79%
We also live in “the best of times,”
which will be my emphasis.

00:55.018 --> 00:59.489 align:center line:79%
The Lord in the preface to the Doctrine
and Covenants, section 1, declared,

00:59.489 --> 01:01.491 align:center line:81%
the fullness of the gospel would be

01:01.491 --> 01:04.261 align:center line:79%
... proclaimed unto the
ends of the world.”

01:05.162 --> 01:09.399 align:center line:79%
The Lord is truly
hastening His work in our time.

01:10.300 --> 01:14.805 align:center line:79%
We should be profoundly
grateful for the hastening, which has

01:14.871 --> 01:19.009 align:center line:79%
and is occurring despite
these challenging times.

01:19.543 --> 01:24.214 align:center line:79%
We live in a day when the Lord’s
followers are privileged to hear His voice

01:24.615 --> 01:27.451 align:center line:81%
and respond with open hearts and minds.

01:28.018 --> 01:31.288 align:center line:79%
Members of The Church
of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints,

01:32.022 --> 01:35.659 align:center line:79%
who are committed to the Savior
and His commandments,

01:36.159 --> 01:40.530 align:center line:79%
are finding purpose
and profound personal peace.

01:41.365 --> 01:43.700 align:center line:79%
At various times
in the history of the Church,

01:43.700 --> 01:46.937 align:center line:79%
there has been a significant
increase in those

01:46.937 --> 01:48.872 align:center line:81%
who have entered the covenant path.

01:49.306 --> 01:56.113 align:center line:79%
One such period occurred between 1837
and 1850. Some of the early apostles

01:56.113 --> 02:00.517 align:center line:79%
and the Lord’s restored Church
served missions in the United Kingdom.

02:01.318 --> 02:05.389 align:center line:79%
These missions resulted
in thousands joining the Church,

02:05.689 --> 02:10.060 align:center line:79%
and by 1850 there were more members
of the Church living

02:10.060 --> 02:13.430 align:center line:79%
in the United Kingdom
than in the United States.

02:14.131 --> 02:18.268 align:center line:79%
At that time, the Lord directed
these Saints to gather to Utah.

02:19.069 --> 02:21.204 align:center line:81%
A mass emigration occurred,

02:21.571 --> 02:27.644 align:center line:79%
some supported by loans provided
through the Perpetual Emigrating Fund.

02:28.311 --> 02:33.450 align:center line:79%
I love the account of the arrival
to the Salt Lake Valley of a large number

02:33.450 --> 02:34.885 align:center line:81%
of converts from England

02:34.885 --> 02:41.525 align:center line:79%
and Wales in 1852. The group was met
by the First Presidency at the mouth

02:41.525 --> 02:46.430 align:center line:79%
of Emigration Canyon,
accompanied by Captain Pitt’s Band.

02:47.164 --> 02:52.169 align:center line:79%
The Deseret News described them as,
“A band of pilgrims,

02:52.169 --> 02:54.171 align:center line:81%
[including] sisters and children,

02:54.471 --> 02:58.608 align:center line:79%
walking, sunburnt, and weather-beaten
but not forlorn;

02:59.309 --> 03:02.079 align:center line:81%
their hearts were light and buoyant,

03:02.412 --> 03:05.415 align:center line:81%
which was plainly manifest by their happy

03:05.615 --> 03:10.153 align:center line:79%
and joyful countenances.”
As they “passed the temple block, ...

03:10.220 --> 03:12.055 align:center line:81%
thousands of men, women,

03:12.055 --> 03:17.494 align:center line:79%
and children gathered from various parts
of the city to unite in the glorious

03:17.494 --> 03:21.998 align:center line:79%
and joyful welcome.” President
Brigham Young addressed them,

03:22.966 --> 03:26.803 align:center line:81%
“May the Lord God of Israel bless you, ...

03:27.370 --> 03:29.473 align:center line:81%
We have prayed for you continually;

03:30.140 --> 03:34.177 align:center line:79%
thousands of prayers have been offered
up for you, day by day,

03:34.878 --> 03:38.715 align:center line:79%
to Him who has commanded us
to gather Israel,

03:39.149 --> 03:42.719 align:center line:79%
save the children of men by
the preaching of the gospel,

03:43.120 --> 03:47.357 align:center line:79%
and prepare them
for the coming of the Messiah.”

03:48.825 --> 03:51.461 align:center line:81%
In the spirit of that joyful occasion,

03:51.862 --> 03:55.665 align:center line:81%
let me once again assure all new converts

03:56.433 --> 03:59.269 align:center line:81%
and those returning to the Lord’s Church,

04:00.170 --> 04:02.839 align:center line:81%
we love you; we need you;

04:03.473 --> 04:04.708 align:center line:81%
the Lord needs you.

04:05.776 --> 04:09.946 align:center line:79%
We may not welcome you
with marching bands,

04:10.547 --> 04:14.718 align:center line:79%
but we pray the blessings of heaven
will attend your efforts

04:15.118 --> 04:20.090 align:center line:79%
to progress along the covenant
path that leads to God the Father

04:20.290 --> 04:23.426 align:center line:81%
and Jesus Christ in the celestial kingdom.

04:24.461 --> 04:28.799 align:center line:79%
There is clear evidence that faith
in Jesus Christ is increasing in our day.

04:29.633 --> 04:31.067 align:center line:81%
In The Church of Jesus Christ

04:31.067 --> 04:36.706 align:center line:79%
of Latter-day Saints, there
has been a remarkable increase in converts

04:36.706 --> 04:38.842 align:center line:81%
and convert participation.

04:40.577 --> 04:48.485 align:center line:79%
In the last 36 months, nearly
900,000 converts have joined the Church.

04:48.485 --> 04:54.691 align:center line:79%
These converts constitute approximately
5 percent of the total Church membership.

04:55.525 --> 04:58.128 align:center line:81%
We welcome new members with open arms

04:58.128 --> 05:01.331 align:center line:79%
and deep appreciation
for the path you have chosen.

05:02.199 --> 05:04.568 align:center line:81%
These 900,000 converts

05:04.568 --> 05:10.173 align:center line:79%
in the last 36 months exceed
the total membership of the Church

05:10.674 --> 05:19.316 align:center line:79%
at its 110th anniversary in 1940,
which was just over 860,000 members.

05:20.550 --> 05:23.720 align:center line:79%
That was the year
Elder Jeffrey R. Holland,

05:24.020 --> 05:27.290 align:center line:81%
Elder Dieter F Uchtdorf, and I were born.

05:28.124 --> 05:32.896 align:center line:79%
These wonderful new converts
come from every part of the world.

05:33.563 --> 05:35.732 align:center line:81%
In the first six months of this year,

05:35.932 --> 05:41.271 align:center line:79%
conversions have risen by more
than 20 percent over the previous year in

05:41.271 --> 05:46.343 align:center line:79%
Europe, Africa, Asia, the Pacific,
and Latin America.

05:46.810 --> 05:50.280 align:center line:79%
In North America,
we have seen a 17 percent increase.

05:51.047 --> 05:55.018 align:center line:79%
The Lord's work continues
to move forward in powerful ways.

05:55.652 --> 06:01.725 align:center line:79%
These rising numbers are a clear
witness that the gospel is touching hearts

06:01.725 --> 06:04.127 align:center line:81%
and changing lives everywhere.

06:05.428 --> 06:10.934 align:center line:79%
In our day, these precious converts
no longer gather to a central location.

06:11.868 --> 06:15.772 align:center line:79%
Because of the faith and consecration
of the members of the Church,

06:16.206 --> 06:20.210 align:center line:79%
resources are available
to support congregations,

06:20.377 --> 06:25.749 align:center line:79%
with the constructions of chapels
and temples across the entire world.

06:26.349 --> 06:30.086 align:center line:79%
With the necessary priesthood
keys and the resources provided,

06:30.453 --> 06:35.425 align:center line:79%
saving ordinances are now available
in most parts of the world.

06:36.326 --> 06:38.161 align:center line:81%
Regardless of where we live,

06:38.728 --> 06:43.667 align:center line:79%
current members need to welcome hundreds
of thousands of new members

06:44.234 --> 06:48.972 align:center line:79%
as we did the English and Welsh
Saints I described from our early history.

06:49.706 --> 06:53.743 align:center line:79%
I loved Elder Garrett W. Gong’s
talk in this session,

06:54.010 --> 06:56.913 align:center line:79%
where he taught us
that no one should sit alone,

06:56.913 --> 06:59.082 align:center line:81%
either emotionally or spiritually.

06:59.916 --> 07:03.019 align:center line:79%
Our sacred duty is to accept
and welcome new

07:03.019 --> 07:06.957 align:center line:79%
and returning members.
As the Lord hastens His work,

07:07.324 --> 07:13.063 align:center line:79%
we should love, nurture, and serve
those who accept His gospel.

07:13.763 --> 07:19.235 align:center line:79%
We can help build a Zion people where
we are one “of one heart and one mind,

07:19.469 --> 07:23.239 align:center line:79%
and [dwell] in righteousness.”
To be one with the Lord,

07:23.873 --> 07:26.543 align:center line:81%
we must be one before the Lord.

07:27.043 --> 07:30.046 align:center line:81%
All members, regardless of baptism date,

07:30.447 --> 07:33.450 align:center line:81%
share a responsibility to welcome others.

07:34.084 --> 07:36.386 align:center line:81%
My counsel to the members of the Church is

07:36.386 --> 07:40.390 align:center line:79%
to wrap our arms around
these precious elect people

07:40.724 --> 07:43.927 align:center line:79%
who have accepted the gospel
of Jesus Christ.

07:44.627 --> 07:49.366 align:center line:79%
President Gordon B. Hinckley taught
us that a new convert needs “a friend,

07:49.399 --> 07:53.703 align:center line:79%
a responsibility, and nurturing
with ‘the good word of God.’”

07:54.371 --> 08:00.577 align:center line:79%
We can be among the friends who assure
these new converts that they belong

08:01.044 --> 08:04.180 align:center line:79%
and are not just guests,
and don't sit alone.

08:04.948 --> 08:08.885 align:center line:79%
We can help them understand
that they are disciples of Jesus Christ,

08:09.285 --> 08:13.089 align:center line:79%
who can minister to others
and accept callings

08:13.089 --> 08:19.129 align:center line:79%
to serve. Young converts should consider
serving a full-time mission.

08:19.896 --> 08:24.501 align:center line:79%
All should be determined
to strive to live a Christlike life.

08:25.135 --> 08:30.240 align:center line:79%
Many join the Church at great personal
sacrifice and desperately need the love

08:30.240 --> 08:32.308 align:center line:81%
and support of their fellow Saints.

08:32.976 --> 08:36.079 align:center line:79%
To those of you who are new
or returning to the faith,

08:36.679 --> 08:38.882 align:center line:81%
there are challenges you may face.

08:39.416 --> 08:41.785 align:center line:81%
Be patient with yourself.

08:42.419 --> 08:45.588 align:center line:79%
The missionaries have taught
you the essential doctrine

08:45.989 --> 08:49.793 align:center line:79%
and explained the covenants
and ordinances of the kingdom,

08:50.260 --> 08:53.630 align:center line:79%
which are set forth in the scriptures
and in Preach My Gospel.

08:54.264 --> 08:56.699 align:center line:81%
Receiving the ordinances and covenants

08:56.699 --> 08:59.302 align:center line:81%
and living the commandments are essential.

08:59.903 --> 09:04.374 align:center line:79%
Focus on the covenants
necessary for exaltation.

09:05.241 --> 09:08.278 align:center line:81%
The gospel makes exaltation possible,

09:08.578 --> 09:13.783 align:center line:79%
which requires the making and keeping
of sacred covenants with God.

09:14.417 --> 09:17.020 align:center line:81%
Except for baptism, confirmation,

09:17.387 --> 09:20.690 align:center line:79%
and the conferral of the Melchizedek
Priesthood for men,

09:21.357 --> 09:26.296 align:center line:79%
the covenants we enter are performed
in the temple. For the dead,

09:26.529 --> 09:31.067 align:center line:79%
each of these saving ordinances are only
performed in the temple.

09:31.868 --> 09:38.775 align:center line:79%
Accordingly, preparing yourself for the
temple should be an immediate goal.

09:39.242 --> 09:42.378 align:center line:79%
You will at times feel
inadequate about what you know.

09:42.812 --> 09:48.118 align:center line:79%
Gospel knowledge is a great
blessing obtained incrementally over time,

09:48.418 --> 09:50.720 align:center line:81%
but it is not a saving ordinance.

09:51.254 --> 09:55.158 align:center line:79%
The gospel is not a test
of knowledge. However,

09:55.158 --> 09:57.460 align:center line:81%
as President Nelson has promised,

09:57.894 --> 10:00.964 align:center line:79%
“[A]s you prayerfully study the Book
of Mormon every day,

10:01.498 --> 10:03.600 align:center line:79%
you will make better
decisions—every day. ...

10:04.100 --> 10:05.735 align:center line:81%
As you ponder what you study,

10:05.735 --> 10:08.805 align:center line:81%
the windows of heaven will open,

10:08.805 --> 10:12.008 align:center line:79%
and you will receive
answers to your own questions

10:12.175 --> 10:14.377 align:center line:81%
and direction for your own life.”

10:15.078 --> 10:17.814 align:center line:81%
In addition, each year in rotation,

10:18.114 --> 10:22.819 align:center line:79%
the Church curriculum in Sunday
meetings covers the Old Testament,

10:22.819 --> 10:26.589 align:center line:79%
the New Testament, the Book of Mormon,
and the Doctrine and Covenants.

10:26.890 --> 10:33.296 align:center line:79%
Over time, you will feel more
confident as your gospel knowledge grows.

10:33.696 --> 10:36.366 align:center line:81%
Regular study of the scriptures will bless

10:36.699 --> 10:40.870 align:center line:79%
and enrich your lives by
deepening your conversion

10:40.870 --> 10:42.972 align:center line:81%
to the gospel of Jesus Christ.

10:44.240 --> 10:48.578 align:center line:79%
Learning the pure doctrine
of Jesus Christ is a lifelong pursuit,

10:48.978 --> 10:53.550 align:center line:79%
both in understanding doctrine
and living a Christlike life.

10:54.050 --> 10:59.689 align:center line:79%
Essential covenants provide a framework
which we describe as the covenant path.

11:00.256 --> 11:04.360 align:center line:79%
These principles have been powerfully
taught by President Nelson.

11:04.827 --> 11:08.431 align:center line:79%
All members, especially
new and returning ones,

11:08.631 --> 11:14.871 align:center line:79%
would be blessed by studying and adopting
his prophetic messages on covenants

11:14.871 --> 11:16.306 align:center line:81%
and the covenant path.

11:16.973 --> 11:21.978 align:center line:79%
If you set a goal of worthily receiving
each covenant necessary for exaltation,

11:22.278 --> 11:26.015 align:center line:79%
you will be on the path that leads
to the celestial kingdom.

11:26.616 --> 11:30.320 align:center line:79%
The temple and the ordinances
of the temple should be our focus.

11:30.620 --> 11:34.591 align:center line:79%
Most covenants are available
to each individual. One

11:34.757 --> 11:39.996 align:center line:79%
covenant, eternal marriage, involves
uniting your efforts with a companion.

11:40.463 --> 11:44.267 align:center line:79%
Our goal should be to find
that eternal companion.

11:44.634 --> 11:49.539 align:center line:79%
However, do not get
discouraged if eternal marriage is not

11:49.539 --> 11:51.407 align:center line:81%
possible at this time.

11:51.941 --> 11:57.247 align:center line:79%
Prophets have taught that no blessing
will be withheld from faithful members

11:57.247 --> 11:58.881 align:center line:81%
who keep the commandments.

11:59.315 --> 12:03.186 align:center line:79%
One Book of Mormon prophet,
King Benjamin, said it beautifully.

12:03.186 --> 12:08.191 align:center line:79%
“Those that keep the commandments
of God ... are blessed in all things ...

12:08.524 --> 12:10.560 align:center line:79%
and if they ... [are] faithful
to the end ...

12:10.793 --> 12:14.831 align:center line:79%
they may dwell with God
in a state of never-ending happiness.”

12:15.665 --> 12:20.703 align:center line:79%
You will find, if you have not already,
that the members are not perfect.

12:21.237 --> 12:26.142 align:center line:79%
Revealed doctrine makes it clear
that in our sojourn here on earth,

12:26.442 --> 12:27.944 align:center line:81%
we will make mistakes.

12:28.611 --> 12:33.049 align:center line:79%
We live in an imperfect and fallen world,
not a celestial world.

12:33.950 --> 12:38.855 align:center line:79%
This life is a time of testing
with constant opportunities to repent

12:39.022 --> 12:44.060 align:center line:79%
and prove ourselves.
All of us feel inadequate as we strive

12:44.060 --> 12:46.229 align:center line:81%
to become like Jesus Christ.

12:46.696 --> 12:51.734 align:center line:79%
His Atonement allows us
to repent daily as we fall short.

12:52.268 --> 12:55.805 align:center line:79%
As Nephi, another Book
of Mormon prophet, said:

12:56.506 --> 12:59.976 align:center line:79%
“[We] must press forward
with a steadfastness in Christ,

13:00.243 --> 13:05.181 align:center line:79%
having a perfect brightness of hope,
and a love of God and of all men.

13:05.648 --> 13:10.520 align:center line:79%
Wherefore, if ye shall press forward,
feasting upon the word of Christ,

13:10.920 --> 13:15.258 align:center line:79%
and endure to the end,
behold, thus saith the Father:

13:15.458 --> 13:17.627 align:center line:81%
Ye shall have eternal life.”

13:18.261 --> 13:24.934 align:center line:79%
As we contemplate the challenges of our
day, we must remember that the Savior,

13:25.268 --> 13:31.674 align:center line:79%
during His earthly ministry,
also lived in turbulent and violent times.

13:32.275 --> 13:35.812 align:center line:79%
His focus was not on the political
challenges of the day;

13:36.579 --> 13:39.582 align:center line:81%
it was on the perfection of the Saints.

13:40.249 --> 13:42.585 align:center line:81%
Following the Savior and His doctrine

13:42.852 --> 13:48.825 align:center line:79%
and teachings has never been easy in a
world that is constantly in commotion.

13:49.392 --> 13:56.966 align:center line:79%
It was not easy for the Savior in the
volatile world during his mortal sojourn,

13:57.400 --> 14:00.870 align:center line:79%
it was not easy for our early
leaders and members,

14:01.237 --> 14:03.639 align:center line:81%
and it is not easy for us.

14:04.407 --> 14:09.545 align:center line:79%
Fortunately, living prophets
provide the guidance we respectfully need

14:09.545 --> 14:16.753 align:center line:79%
for our day. President Dallin H. Oaks
will continue that spiritually

14:16.753 --> 14:22.225 align:center line:79%
powerful legacy. I testify
that the doctrine of the Church

14:22.225 --> 14:25.661 align:center line:81%
of Jesus Christ is eternal and true.

14:26.262 --> 14:30.566 align:center line:79%
I bear my sure and certain
witness that Jesus Christ lives

14:31.300 --> 14:36.072 align:center line:79%
and because of His Atonement,
we can be one with Him.

14:36.606 --> 14:39.208 align:center line:81%
In the sacred name of Jesus Christ,

14:39.242 --> 14:40.777 align:center line:81%
amen.

